    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nA superbly located farm holding extending to approximately 8.59 Hectares (21.25 acres), comprising a traditional farmhouse, extensive grazing lands and a derelict cottage. The property offers an excellent opportunity to acquire a substantial and versatile rural holding with considerable potential, subject to the necessary planning permissions and consents.\n\nThe property is offered for sale in one or more lots as follows:\n\nLOT 1 Farmhouse on 0.16 Ha (0.40 Acres)\nFolio CN26054\n\nBuilt circa the 1940s, the farmhouse comprises a detached two-storey residence extending to approximately 128 sq. m. The spacious accommodation includes an entrance hall, sitting room, dining/living room, kitchen, three bedrooms and a bathroom.\n\nSurrounded by mature trees, the property enjoys a wonderfully private and secluded setting, with extensive outdoor space providing an ideal environment for relaxation and a range of future possibilities.\n\nLOT 2 Lands extending to 5.07 Ha (12.55 Acres)\nFolio CN26054\n\nA compact parcel of land extending to approximately 5.07 hectares (12.55 acres), laid out in easily managed divisions. The lands benefit from excellent accessibility, together with substantial road and water frontage, making them suitable for a variety of agricultural uses.\n\nLOT 3 Derelict Cottage & Lands on 1.09 Ha (2.70 Acres)\nFolio CN14215\n\nThe property comprises a derelict cottage together with approximately 1.09 hectares (2.70 acres) of land, offering considerable potential for renovation and restoration. The cottage is in need of complete refurbishment and modernisation throughout, presenting an excellent opportunity to create a home in a tranquil rural setting, subject to the necessary planning permissions and consents.\n\nLOT 4 Lands extending to 2.26 Ha (5.60 Acres)\nFolio CN14215\n\nA compact parcel of land extending to approximately 2.26 hectares (5.60 acres), laid out in one easily managed division. The lands benefit from road frontage and may be suitable for a variety of agricultural uses.\n\nLOT 5 Entire Holding\n\nThe entire holding extends to approximately 8.59 hectares (21.25 acres) and presents a superb opportunity to acquire a versatile residential and agricultural property in a highly sought-after location.\n\nConveniently situated just 4 km from Killeshandra, 2 km from Killykeen Forest Park and approximately 20 km from Cavan Town, the property enjoys a tranquil rural setting while remaining easily accessible to local amenities and services.\n\nViewing is highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - \n\n\nSitting Room - 5.00m x 4.00m\nCarpet flooring, open hearth fireplace with timber surround.\n\nDining / Living - 4.00m x 3.70m\nCarpet flooring, oil range.\n\nKitchen - 4.58m x 2.57m\nVinyl flooring.\n\nBathroom - 2.13m x 1.67m\nVinyl flooring, bath, w.c., wash hand basin.\n\nBedroom 1 - 5.00m x 3.00m\nCarpet flooring, open hearth fireplace with timber surround.\n\nFirst Floor - \n\n\nBedroom 2 - 5.10m x 4.10m\nCarpet flooring.\n\nBedroom 3 - 5.10m x 3.20m\nCarpet flooring.\n\n"
      },
